* ''One controller stands the dogfood Lararium'' (operator, 2026-11-07: //"Yes, Kia'i works to stand an early Lararium we can 'dogfood' from, so that handoff sits pono with the next milestone."//). The harness lane closed into the seat once its batch landed (PR #202); one controller holds the road, and the harness items it carried rest in seat-harness #/owed.

